growing on this mountainside.  Small butterflies flit to and fro along the
trail, lured on by sweet smelling flowers which grow nearby.  The air is
pure and refreshing, and has a slight scent of flowers wafting through the
air.  To the east, this trail leads up higher into the mountains, while the
western direction leads down from them.
