Traveler's Rest~
   You graciously knock on the door of this dwelling, and immediately the
owner, a charming dwarven lady, by the name of Daphne, beckons you to enter
her humble abode.  This dwelling is much like the chieftain's hut, large and
roomy.  The only difference being that it is much more cheery in here.  A
fire crackles in the center of this room, and in the air, you catch a faint
whiff of flowers.  To the east and north, are other rooms of this hut.
