   This forest is majestic in its greatness; there are many great and ancient
trees here which tower over the forest floor.  In a few places, the golden
light of the sun can be seen filtering through the thick canopy of the forest.
Occasionaly, a few animals can be seen stealthily moving among the bushes,
using as cover, the darkness and shadows of this great forest.  This forest
continues east and west.
~
